SUMMARY:Misc Connections: An Olio House Party
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're looking for new friends\, lovers\, or someone wi
 th a boat\, we're here to make it happen for you. One of our favorite part
 s of running Olio (a miscellaneous collection of art + people) is making c
 onnections between our members based on their niche hobbies\, interests\, 
 or that certain je ne sais quoi. Become a member to join the party\, and y
 ou'll enter a whole new world of connections before the DJ even starts the
 ir set.What to expect:8pm: You're matched with new friends to discuss a co
 uple of curated prompts.9:30pm-midnight: DJ Zimmy Dynamite begins and we d
 ance our asses off until he winds down the evening with an ambient set. Th
 en\, we'll stretch and have tea because we love our bodies.Special pop-up 
 elevated non-alcoholic drinks provided by Sober in Central Park!Tickets:To
  attend this party you can sign up for our monthly membership which gives 
 you two\, $35 credits to use towards Olio events each month.&nbsp\;You mus
 t be 21 or older to attend.What is Think Olio?Think Olio is an ongoing exp
 eriment in lifelong learning. We are a community of open-minded people who
  gather to exchange ideas with new friends and connect over art\, literatu
 re\, and philosophy.An Olio is what we call the social learning events we
 ’ve been organizing since 2015. A blend between a lecture and a house pa
 rty\, Olios are led by a teacher who loves sharing their passions and the 
 room is filled with curious\, open-minded New Yorkers.&nbsp\;Eight months 
 into creating a venue\, one of our favorite feelings has been the moments 
 where we’ve stepped outside of time. We’ve created a space where conve
 rsations don’t feel rushed\, people are greeted with hugs\, and as a com
 munity\, we spontaneously come up with new ideas (like the dial-up-disco h
 ouse party) and bring them to life.Our goal is to spark new perspectives\,
  ignite curiosity\, and enjoy ourselves socially—an alternative to typic
 al nightlife options.Check out our full calendarDisclaimer: By purchasing 
 a ticket\, you agree to have your photo/video used for social media/market
 ing materials. If you prefer to not have your photo taken\, feel free to s
 end us a note.\n\nTickets & info: https://www.viewcy.com/event/olio_house_
 party
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/olio_house_party
END:VEVENT
